#   time_origin - HighResolutionTime: time origins, coarsened and relative high resolution times
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/HighResolutionTime/TimeOrigin.cpp (lines 1-113) and
#       TimeOrigin.h. The file was outside the skeleton's phase-1 closure; region r19 ported it
#       because every DOM::Event records its creation time (Event::Event) and dispatch_event
#       stamps user activations. DOMHighResTimeStamp is f64, in milliseconds.
